# 英語の発話の正常系: plan → 3 段の計画 → 承認 → 段 1..3 で a/b/c.txt を書く → 完走 → 削除（画面は英語）
{"when": {"role": "user", "contains": "Create three files"}, "reply": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "write_file", "args": {"path": "{plan_file}", "content": "# Plan\n\n## Steps\n1. Create a.txt (~5 lines)\n2. Create b.txt (~5 lines)\n3. Create c.txt (~5 lines)\n"}}]}, "note": "計画を書く"}
{"when": {"role": "tool", "tool": "write_file", "contains": ".satsuma/plans/"}, "reply": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {}}]}, "note": "承認を求める"}
{"when": {"role": "tool", "tool": "exit_plan_mode", "contains": "Do ONLY step 1 of 3"}, "reply": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "write_file", "args": {"path": "a.txt", "content": "a\n"}}]}, "note": "段 1"}
{"when": {"role": "user", "contains": "Now do ONLY step 2 of 3"}, "reply": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "write_file", "args": {"path": "b.txt", "content": "b\n"}}]}, "note": "段 2"}
{"when": {"role": "user", "contains": "Now do the last step (3 of 3)"}, "reply": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "write_file", "args": {"path": "c.txt", "content": "c\n"}}]}, "note": "段 3"}
{"when": {"role": "tool", "tool": "write_file", "contains": "a.txt"}, "reply": {"text": "Step 1 done: created a.txt."}, "note": "段 1 の要約"}
{"when": {"role": "tool", "tool": "write_file", "contains": "b.txt"}, "reply": {"text": "Step 2 done: created b.txt."}, "note": "段 2 の要約"}
{"when": {"role": "tool", "tool": "write_file", "contains": "c.txt"}, "reply": {"text": "All steps are done."}, "note": "最終段の要約"}
{"when": {"role": "user", "contains": "Delete the files"}, "reply": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "delete_path", "args": {"path": "a.txt"}}, {"name": "delete_path", "args": {"path": "b.txt"}}, {"name": "delete_path", "args": {"path": "c.txt"}}]}, "note": "削除（カードが 3 回出る）"}
{"when": {"role": "tool", "tool": "delete_path"}, "reply": {"text": "Deleted the 3 files."}, "note": "削除の報告"}
